  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-12b-2024-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The inequality \\(|2x| \\le 7\\pi\\) is equivalent to \\(|x| \\le \\dfrac{7\\pi}{2} \\approx 10.99.\\) The integers satisfying this run from \\(-10\\) to \\(10,\\) which is \\(10 + 10 + 1 = 21\\) values.\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Rewrite as \\(|x| \\le \\dfrac{7\\pi}{2}\\) and estimate \\(\\dfrac{7\\pi}{2}\\) as a decimal",
        "Since \\(\\dfrac{7\\pi}{2} \\approx 10.99,\\) count the integers from \\(-10\\) to \\(10\\)"
      ],
